{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796","id":658249084,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NTgyNDkwODQ=","number":11796,"title":"Race condition in VanillaJavaBuilder","user":{"login":"asuffield","id":1300408,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDA0MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300408?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield","html_url":"https://github.com/asuffield","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asuffield/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106503259,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY1MDMyNTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":192364170,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTIzNjQxNzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"We'll consider working on this in future. (Assignee optional)"},{"id":1020663976,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDIwNjYzOTc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/team-Rules-Java","name":"team-Rules-Java","color":"f1f442","default":false,"description":"Issues for Java rules"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2020-07-16T14:25:22Z","updated_at":"2020-07-23T19:21:06Z","closed_at":"2020-07-23T19:21:06Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Under sufficiently high load when using VanillaJavaBuilder, we intermittently see this exception crashing the worker:\r\n\r\n---8<---8<--- Start of log, file at …/bazel-workers/worker-1-Javac.log ---8<---8<---\r\njava.nio.file.NoSuchFileException: bazel-out/k8-fastbuild/bin/build-plugin-showcase/testing-build-plugin-generated.srcjar\r\n\\tat sun.nio.fs.UnixException.translateToIOException(UnixException.java:86)\r\n\\tat sun.nio.fs.UnixException.rethrowAsIOException(UnixException.java:102)\r\n\\tat sun.nio.fs.UnixException.rethrowAsIOException(UnixException.java:107)\r\n\\tat sun.nio.fs.UnixPath.toRealPath(UnixPath.java:837)\r\n\\tat com.sun.nio.zipfs.ZipFileSystemProvider.removeFileSystem(ZipFileSystemProvider.java:322)\r\n\\tat com.sun.nio.zipfs.ZipFileSystem.close(ZipFileSystem.java:305)\r\n\\tat com.google.devtools.build.buildjar.VanillaJavaBuilder.close(VanillaJavaBuilder.java:348)\r\n\\tat com.google.devtools.build.buildjar.VanillaJavaBuilder.runPersistentWorker(VanillaJavaBuilder.java:114)\r\n\\tat com.google.devtools.build.buildjar.VanillaJavaBuilder.main(VanillaJavaBuilder.java:89)\r\n---8<---8<--- End of log ---8<---8<---\r\n\r\nSome debugging later has tracked this down to a race condition between VanillaJavaBuilder's cleanup functions and bazel's; the semantics are that once a worker has sent back the response to the bazel server, it can't assume any input files still exist, because bazel will start deleting them.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/pull/11777 fixes this","closed_by":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io","html_url":"https://github.com/bazel-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11796/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}